WEBVTT

00:15:59.016 --> 00:16:00.167
and imagining,

00:16:00.191 --> 00:16:02.803
"If this happened to my children,

00:16:02.827 --> 00:16:04.445
to my parents,

00:16:04.469 --> 00:16:06.091
to my spouse,

00:16:06.115 --> 00:16:08.712
to my neighbors, to my community,

00:16:08.736 --> 00:16:10.064
if I took that ...

00:16:11.537 --> 00:16:13.244
How will it be remembered?"

00:16:14.683 --> 00:16:16.084
And with that,

00:16:16.108 --> 00:16:18.421
I hope, as we all leave here

00:16:18.445 --> 00:16:20.699
and venture off
to build our own moon shots,

00:16:20.723 --> 00:16:22.517
we don't just conceptualize them,

00:16:22.541 --> 00:16:26.520
in a way, as a means
for people to survive

00:16:26.544 --> 00:16:33.041
but really see them as opportunities
and chances for everybody to thrive.